<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">日常小决定</view><view class="title">{{user ? '你的每一份小记录' : '让小记录，跟着你'}}</view><view class="muted">游客也能直接使用。登录后，菜单和待办可与 H5 同步。</view>
 <view wx:if="{{user}}" class="card stack"><view class="section-title">{{user.email}}</view><view class="note">{{status}}</view><button class="primary" bindtap="sync" disabled="{{busy}}">{{busy ? '正在同步…' : '刷新同步'}}</button><view wx:if="{{importNeeded}}" class="import-box"><view class="section-title">导入此设备的游客记录？</view><view class="note">已有云端菜单保留，待办追加；游客数据也会保留。</view><view class="row"><button class="secondary small" bindtap="importGuest" disabled="{{busy}}">导入游客数据</button><button class="link small" bindtap="skipImport" disabled="{{busy}}">暂不导入</button></view></view><button class="link" bindtap="logout" disabled="{{busy}}">退出登录</button></view>
 <view wx:elif="{{screen === 'verify' || screen === 'resetSent'}}" class="card verification"><view class="verification-icon">✉</view><view class="section-title">{{screen === 'verify' ? '请确认你的邮箱' : '请查看密码重置邮件'}}</view><view class="note">{{screen === 'verify' ? '确认邮件已发往' : '如该邮箱已注册，重置邮件将发往'}} {{email}}</view><view class="steps">1. 打开邮箱，检查收件箱和垃圾箱。
2. {{screen === 'verify' ? '点击邮件中的确认链接，完成邮箱确认。' : '点击邮件链接，在 H5 页面设置新的本站登录密码。'}}
3. 返回小程序，使用邮箱和本站登录密码登录。</view><button class="primary" data-screen="login" bindtap="switchScreen">返回登录</button><button class="link" bindtap="copySite">复制 H5 地址</button></view>
 <view wx:else class="card stack"><view wx:if="{{screen !== 'reset'}}" class="tabs"><button class="{{screen === 'login' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-screen="login" bindtap="switchScreen" disabled="{{busy}}">登录</button><button class="{{screen === 'signup' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-screen="signup" bindtap="switchScreen" disabled="{{busy}}">注册</button></view><view wx:else class="section-title">重置本站登录密码</view><view class="field"><view class="label">邮箱</view><input class="input" type="text" value="{{email}}" bindinput="emailInput" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="你注册本站时的邮箱" maxlength="254"/></view><view wx:if="{{screen !== 'reset'}}" class="field"><view class="label">{{screen === 'signup' ? '设置本站登录密码' : '本站登录密码'}}</view><input class="input" password value="{{password}}" bindinput="passwordInput" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="至少 8 个字符" maxlength="128"/><view class="note">{{screen === 'signup' ? '用于登录日常小决定，不是你的邮箱密码。' : '输入你注册日常小决定时设置的密码，不是邮箱密码。'}}</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy}}">{{busy ? '正在处理…' : screen === 'signup' ? '注册账号' : screen === 'reset' ? '发送重置邮件' : '登录并同步'}}</button><button wx:if="{{screen === 'reset'}}" class="link" data-screen="login" bindtap="switchScreen" disabled="{{busy}}">返回登录</button><button wx:else class="link" data-screen="reset" bindtap="switchScreen" disabled="{{busy}}">忘记本站登录密码？</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{message}}" class="error">{{message}}</view><view class="card information"><view class="section-title">关于保存与同步</view><view class="note">游客记录保存在此设备。登录后，每个账号的数据单独保存；网络失败时修改保留在本机，联网或刷新后重试。</view><view class="note">邮箱确认和密码重置使用 H5 页面。小程序与 H5 登录同一个邮箱账号即可同步；这里暂不提供微信一键登录。</view><button class="link small" bindtap="copySite">复制 H5 地址 ↗</button></view>
</view>
